      "text": "Scratch project for charting questions. Carries no timestamps: the export omitted created_at and updated_at, which is the shape this fixture exists to pin.\nAnswer as a stellar cartographer. Give coordinates in standard galactic form and say when a reading is extrapolated rather than measured.\n# Charting conventions\n\nBearings are given from the ship's current heading, not from galactic north.\n\n- Sector designations use the Federation catalogue number, never the local name.\n- An extrapolated position is written in parentheses.\n",
