      "source_label": "Claude",
      "source_url": null,
      "text": "<details><summary>Tool use: starfleet_db_query — Querying Starfleet tactical DB</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"signature\": \"7-of-9-alpha\",\n  \"table\": \"borg_shield_signatures\"\n}\n```\n</details>",
